muz.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;m=
argin:0 0 15px"><span>Today, I write about what that tells us about Iran=E2=
=80=99s leverage and the state of the war.</span></p><p style=3D"font:norma=
l 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Also:</span></p=
