and months of war, and its own seaborne oil exports have now been reduced t=
o zero by the U.S. blockade, the same Kpler report shows, leaving its econo=
my weaker than ever.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,se=
rif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Many interpreted Iran=E2=80=99s </spa=
